置

$$
\begin{aligned}
\lambda_m^2&=\frac m{D^2},\\
g_m&=\frac{4m}{D^2}\sin^2\left(\frac{dD}{2m}\right),\\
r_e&=1-(1-g_m)(1-\lambda_m^2)^q,\\
B_e&=\min\{1,2\sqrt{r_e}\}.
